# Signing material must never reach this public repository. The real keystore lives outside the
# checkout entirely; these patterns are the second line of defence for a copy that lands here by
# mistake, and signing-cert-sha256.txt is an output of the "Signed release build" workflow.
*.p12
*.pem
signing-cert-sha256.txt
# First-publication handoff: only the workflow's explicit PUBLIC allowlist may be force-added.
.signing-handoff/
KEYSTORE-PASSWORD.txt
keystore-password.txt
keystore.b64
identity.tar
*-signing-backup.zip
*-signing-backup.7z
*-backup.7z
.private-owner-backup/
